{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Warsaw, in what was then the Russian Empire — though I have spent most of my adult life in France. Warsaw is where I grew up, where I lost my mother when I was only ten, and where I first discovered my love for mathematics and science.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Warsaw, in what was then the Kingdom of Poland under Russian rule. It was a difficult time and place to grow up — my family had lost much of its property and fortune because of our involvement in patriotic uprisings against the occupying authorities.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Warsaw, in what was then the Kingdom of Poland under the Russian Empire. My family lived on Freta Street, and my father taught mathematics and physics there.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Warsaw, in what was then the Kingdom of Poland under Russian rule. It was a difficult time for our country, but my family made the best of it — my parents were both teachers, and they made sure we children received a good education despite the circumstances.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Warsaw, in what was then the Kingdom of Poland under the Russian Empire. It was a difficult time and place to grow up — my family were teachers and Polish patriots, and we had to navigate the restrictions imposed upon us. But Warsaw is where my story began.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
